    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Schiffspfund, a Baltic-Hanseatic unit of weight approximately 136 kg (300 lb.), equivalent to twenty lispounds (OED s.v. shippound); used as a measure of iron, wax, and dry goods</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
